error[NK1131]: You can't give away `x.t` here: `x` is only borrowed.
   --> tests/lambda_field_handed_out_is_refused.nika:14:47
    |
 14 |     let v: Vec[String] = m.iter().map(fn(x) { x.t }).collect()
    |                                               ^^^
    |
    = note: `x` belongs to whoever lent it (a parameter without `keep`, a `for` over a list, a `let` over a place), and `x.t` is a `String`. Giving it away would take a piece out of something this function doesn't own.
    = help: Write `x.t.clone()` for a copy: a lambda hands back a value of its own.
